cially when the number of ranking attributes is not small ( 𝑑≥3),
since the size of the arrangement (hence, the space complexity) in-
creases exponentially with 𝑑. Therefore, in this section, we propose
practical solutions that keep the space complexity linear, i.e., 𝑂(𝑛).
Our algorithms are based on the computational geometric concept
of𝜀-samples [50] (also introduced in Section 4).
