6.1 Eps2D :𝜀-sampling in 2D
In this section, we discuss our solution based on 𝜀-samples in 2D,
called Eps2D , also illustrated in Figure 1.
Preprocessing . During the preprocessing phase, the algorithm
computes an 𝜀-sample of the dataset D, where the ranges are stripe
ranges . We denote this 𝜀-sample byN𝜀, for a given parameter 𝜀.
Query Answering . Let𝑚=|N𝜀|denote the size of the 𝜀-sample
built during the preprocessing, where 𝑚≪𝑛.9We take the follow-
