tion𝑓is sampled uniformly from the unit hypersphere in R𝑑. We
vary the stripeS𝑓,ℓ,𝑢 by adjusting its width, i.e., the number of
points it contains. Figure 4 presents the query time performance
across different dimensionalities 𝑑as a function of stripe width. We
